        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana PCT300, Traditional Decorative Cabinet Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBead designs are a true classics for cabinet hardware, and for good reason. They speak of history while still able to remain very current. This 3\" Decorative Cabinet Handle will look as great in a traditional kitchen as it would on a brightly painted end table. The possibilities are endless, especially since it is available in eight decorative finishes. Made of solid brass, this traditional style decorative pull handle is great for cabinets, drawers, furniture or small utility type doors. Packaged complete with screws for easy installation. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-PCT300-size.gif?v=1704354552\" width=\"431\" height=\"187\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana PCT300 Decorative Cabinet Pull Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/beaded-3-1-2-inch-traditional-cabinet-pull-deltana-pct350\"><b>3-1/2\" Decorative Cabinet Pull</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/traditional-4-inch-cabinet-handle-deltana-pct400\"><b>4\" Decorative Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana PCT300 Decorative Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 3\" c.c.</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/PCT300.pdf?v=1691095374\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana PCT300 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose, the cabinet handle will still be <b>high quality solid brass</b>. \r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "3 Inch Traditional Beaded Cabinet Handle | Deltana PCT300",
                "description": "Traditional Decorative Cabinet Handle, Deltana PCT300 - Bead designs are a true classics for cabinet hardware, and for good reason. They speak of history while still able to remain very current. This 3 Inch Decorative Cabinet Handle will look as great in a traditional kitchen as it would on a brightly painted end table. The possibilities are endless, especially since it is available in 8 decorative finishes. Made of solid brass, this traditional style decorative pull handle is great for cabinets, drawers, furniture or small utility type doors. Packaged complete with screws for easy installation.",
